{"text_id":1,"forms":["Shellos changes its color and appearance based on its<br>diet and the environment it lives in.<br><br>We are researching day and night in an attempt to<br>create a heretofore unknown yellow Shellos."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[577],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":2,"forms":["The project originally set to launch next month is<br>moving ahead with preparations, despite its low<br>chance of success.<br><br>We took it upon ourselves to collect data and<br>perform our own calculations. A report on the<br>dangers that came to light from said calculations<br>is included herein.<br><br>With this in mind, we ask that you please seriously<br>consider canceling the project."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[776],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":3,"forms":["Companies involved in the space exploration industry<br>are at each other’s throat these days. I’m feeling the<br>pain of it myself, as I’ve been put in charge of caring<br>for some Porygon2 meant for planetary exploration.<br>It’s a lot of work!<br><br>Today, one of those three Porygon2 seems unwell.<br>I ordered a patch that sounded effective and applied<br>it, so I hope it will feel better tomorrow."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1172],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":4,"forms":["Our organization is implementing a new plan in the<br>hope of overcoming our past mistakes. See below<br>for details.<br><br>This plan will require the cooperation of our entire<br>organization, not just select departments, so we<br>ask that all members read on and make this their<br>top priority."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1586],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
